<title>LUXEMBOURG: Commission organised consumer-EMU conference.</title>
<headline>Commission organised consumer-EMU conference.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission will hold a round table on May 15 on the consumer policy aspects of economic and monetary union, Consumer Affairs Commissioner Emma Bonino said on Thursday.</p>
<p>She told a news conference after a meeting of the Consumer Council it would cover issues like continuity of contracts under the third stage of EMU.</p>
</text>
